 "request": "P1 -> P2 request: version powertrains contradicted by their own labels (8 Nov 2026)",
 "scope": "powertrain only; no price, identity, spec or media value changed. 23 models change: 18 model powertrain sets (13 entries, 5 market additions) + version-level only on haval/h7, mg/hs, xpeng/m03, xpeng/p7, lexus/rx",
 "fields": {
  "version": "accepted.price.trims[].powertrain in {petrol,hybrid,phev,reev,ev}; trims[].plug_in true/false (null = source does not state it); trims[].powertrain_source {wording,url,sha256,rule:\"VP-1\"}. Versions without a VP-1 row keep their previous value.",
  "model": "entries: accepted.powertrains + accepted.powertrains_correction (rule \"VP-2\"); RC1 top-level powertrains stays verbatim (P5 contract). market_additions: top-level powertrains updated and mirrored in accepted.powertrains. A plug-in version adds both \"hybrid\" and \"phev\" to the model set; \"reev\" is kept as its own value."
 },
